Total sale prices and separately expensed fees affect contributions and profit once.

========== API ==========

investmentPerformance({ accounts: ['^Assets:'], includeCommodities: ['FUND'] })

========== FILE ==========

commodity USD
  format 1,000.00 USD
  default
commodity FUND
  format 1,000.00 FUND
account Assets:Broker
account Assets:Other
account Assets:Cash
account Assets:Unrelated
account Equity:Opening
account Income:Gains
account Expenses:Fees
2024-01-01 Purchase
  Assets:Broker  2 FUND {{200 USD}}
  Assets:Broker  -205 USD
  Expenses:Fees  5 USD
P 2024-01-01 FUND 100 USD
2024-01-02 Sale
  Assets:Broker  -1 FUND {{100 USD}} @@ 130 USD
  Assets:Broker  125 USD
  Expenses:Fees  5 USD
  Income:Gains  -30 USD
P 2024-01-02 FUND 140 USD

